{{! Comment library }}
<h4 id="settings-library">Comment library</h4>
<div class="local-unifiedgrader-help-table local-unifiedgrader-help-table-stack">
<table class="table-reboot">
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Setting</th><th scope="col">Default</th><th scope="col">What it does</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><th scope="row">Require approval for system-default suggestions <code>require_systemdefault_approval</code></th><td data-label="Default">On</td><td>A teacher's suggestion for a system-default comment waits for approval. When off, suggestions become system defaults at once and are still recorded.</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Course code regex <code>coursecode_regex</code></th><td data-label="Default">Empty</td><td>A regular expression that picks the course code out of a course short name, so comments follow a course from one offering to the next. <code>/[A-Z]{3}\d{4}/</code> reads <em>THE2201</em> from <em>THE2201-2026-S1</em>. Empty uses the whole short name.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p>The page also has two tools, each shown only to users who may use it:</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Manage comment library</strong>: the tags and comments every teacher starts with, and the queue of teachers' suggestions to approve or reject.</li>
    <li><strong>Moderate comment libraries</strong>: review teachers' libraries, move comments to another course code or another owner, delete comments, and export libraries as CSV.</li>
</ul>

<details class="local-unifiedgrader-help-details">
