{{! Per activity }}
<h4 id="settings-activity">Settings teachers have on each activity</h4>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Apply late penalties</strong>: a tick box in the <em>Late penalties</em> section of
        assignment, forum and quiz settings on Moodle 5.3. New activities start with it off. An
        activity that existed before the upgrade keeps the behaviour it had until its settings are saved.</li>
    <li><strong>Friction feedback</strong>: the menu in the grader header (Site default, On for this activity, Off for this activity).</li>
</ul>
